{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o022b","title":"寿张击黄巾与鲍信战死","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o022b-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操军在寿张东击黄巾，鲍信力战而死；求其尸不得，众人刻木像祭悼。","evidence":["wudi-e-o022b-q"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-0026f7bcb33c61e2df83","label":"正文","text":"鲍信后为济北相，协规太祖，身以遇害","evidence":["cuimao-q-fbfb0c9563b0f1a82abf"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-9c1d792ebe14a248dadf","label":"裴注·《魏书》","text":"太祖欲设奇兵挑击黄巾于寿张，先与鲍信出行战地，步军未至猝与贼遇遂接战","evidence":["cuimao-q-8b09e38dc918ee45af13"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-977dc4f80e50330cb0a3","label":"裴注·《魏书》","text":"鲍信殊死战以救太祖，太祖仅得溃围出，信遂没，时年四十一","evidence":["cuimao-q-f7f9a2b977ad490cb6a3"]},{"id":"lizang-a-9aba69126d4164556c89","label":"正文","text":"李乾率众随曹操破黄巾于寿张","evidence":["lizang-q-ad4f0936fa1d1b30987f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"领兵作战","evidence":["wudi-e-o022b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0065","role":"战死","evidence":["wudi-e-o022b-q"]},{"person":"lizang-p0034","role":"初平中以众随太祖","evidence":["lizang-q-ad4f0936fa1d1b30987f"]}],"place":{"text":"寿张东","evidence":["wudi-e-o022b-q"]},"time":{"label":"初平三年","year":192,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o022b-q","wudi-q-o019","wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415"],"chronology":"wudi-y192","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o019","basis":"初平三年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,163,"O022b"],"order":83}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"lizang-p0034","name":"李乾","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0065","name":"鲍信","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-8b09e38dc918ee45af13","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖以贼恃胜而骄，欲设奇兵，挑击之于寿张。先与信出行战地，后步军未至，而猝与贼遇，遂接战","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":426,"end":470},{"id":"cuimao-q-f7f9a2b977ad490cb6a3","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-08203b2976224e5bbb3f","layer":"pei","quote":"信殊死战，以救太祖；太祖仅得溃围出，信遂没。时年四十一","attribution":"裴注·《魏书》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":296,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-678dfc7a2f3975ac89c5","start":471,"end":498},{"id":"cuimao-q-fbfb0c9563b0f1a82abf","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-185e400f2a714a9654ae","layer":"original","quote":"后为济北相，协规太祖，身以遇害","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":285,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":71,"end":86},{"id":"lizang-q-ad4f0936fa1d1b30987f","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-05cfa81b113d3f6a0be9","layer":"original","quote":"初平中〖1〗，以众随太祖，破黄巾于寿张","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":51},{"id":"wudi-e-o022b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5505cac06f9494b001a0","layer":"original","quote":"遂进兵，击黄巾于寿张东〖9〗。信力战，斗死，仅而破之〖10〗。﹝二﹞购求信丧不得〖11〗，众乃刻木如信形状，祭而哭焉。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":23,"end":82},{"id":"wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3863a19b555811d1f415","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：初平三年（公元 192）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-2063caf2b642ce9ff2bc","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o019","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620706e925cc9a268c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖1〗，太祖军顿丘，毒等攻东武阳。太祖乃引兵西入山，攻毒等本屯〖2〗。﹝一﹞毒闻之，弃武阳还〖3〗。太祖要击眭固〖4〗，又击匈奴于夫罗于内黄〖5〗，皆大破之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
